flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Clear session]
    B --> C{Email and password pass validation?}
    C -- No --> D[Return INVALID]
    C -- Yes --> E[Prepare user lookup by email and password]
    E --> F[Open DB connection]
    F --> G[Bind email and password]
    G --> H[Execute query]
    H --> I{Matching user found?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Read user_id and role]
    J --> K[Store user_id in session]
    K --> L[Store role in session]
    L --> M[Return role]
    I -- No --> D
    F --> N[On SQL error print stack trace]
    N --> D
    D --> O[End]
    M --> O
